   "source": [
    "# Train LSTM PPO with Minimal Features (22 features)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Test if reducing features from 100 → 22 reduces overfitting\n",
    "\n",
    "**Features:** Evidence-based minimal set from research (Jiang 2017, Zhang 2020)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Data:** Weekly, normalized per-ticker with 52-week rolling z-score"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "✓ Loaded 22 features from metadata_minimal_weekly.json\n",
      "  Using MINIMAL feature set (evidence-based)\n",
      "✓ Imports complete\n"
     ]
    },
